# Local Go build cache (/cache in .gitignore). Untracked and unbounded -- 29GB on the
# machine this was found on, which the daemon transferred as build context on EVERY
# interop image build: >10 minutes, exceeding the native interoplab Docker
# build deadline (internal/le/interoplab/docker.go, dockerBuildTimeoutDefault) and
# saturating the host. Nothing in any Dockerfile reads it. The evidence-nightly
# workflow now runs `./le integration interop`; a context this size would also
# make the nightly job a permanent red.
cache/
docs/
plan/
rfc/
etc/
.claude/
gokrazy/
ai/
test/
!test/perf/configs/
!test/interop-ipsec/ze-linux
!test/interop-radius/ze-linux
*.md
